  "content": "<div class=\"mwsgeneric-base-html parbase section\">\n\n\n\n    <div class=\"retirement-hub\">\n\t<div class=\"bg-right bg-norepeat wb-init wb-bgimg-inited\" data-bgimg-srcset=\"https://wet-boew.github.io/vocab/wb/utilities#no-image 991w, /content/dam/themes/retirement/images/redesign/banner-right.png 992w\" id=\"wb-auto-4\" style='background-image: url(\"/content/dam/themes/retirement/images/redesign/banner-right.png\");'>\n\t\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-7\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1 property=\"name\" id=\"wb-cont\">Learn and plan for your retirement</h1>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mrgn-bttm-md\">Whether you're just starting to think about retirement or already enjoying it, it's always a good time to explore your options and plan for your financial future.</p>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<section class=\"gc-featured-link wb-init gc-featured-link-inited\" data-bg-color=\"#0A747D\" id=\"wb-auto-5\" style=\"background-color: rgb(10, 116, 125); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><div class=\"container\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"wb-inv\">Spotlight on</h2>\n\t\t\t<p style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">If you need help or someone to talk to, <a class=\"stretched-link\" href=\"/en/public-health/services/mental-health-services/mental-health-get-help.html\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">visit our mental health support page</a>.</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</section></div>\n\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"mwsgeneric-base-html parbase section\">\n\n\n\n    <div class=\"mrgn-tp-lg container retirement-hub\">\n\t<div class=\"row d-md-flex\">\n\t\t<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-4 d-md-flex flex-column\">\n\t\t\t<section class=\"cards quiz-content bg-retirement-hub-light\"><div class=\"media\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"media-body\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"mrgn-tp-md\">Start here to plan your retirement!</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"pull-right mrgn-lft-sm mrgn-bttm-sm hidden-xs hidden-sm\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img class=\"mrgn-tp-md hidden-lg\" src=\"/content/dam/themes/retirement/images/redesign/list-clock.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"86\"><img class=\"mrgn-tp-sm hidden-md\" src=\"/content/dam/themes/retirement/images/redesign/list-clock.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mrgn-tp-lg\">Answer a few questions to get your list of things to consider.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mrgn-tp-lg mrgn-bttm-0\">This will take only a few minutes.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img class=\"center-block img-responsive mrgn-tp-lg hidden-sm hidden-md hidden-lg\" src=\"/content/dam/themes/retirement/images/redesign/list-clock.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"190\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"media-right media-middle h2 hidden-xs hidden-md hidden-lg\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/content/dam/themes/retirement/images/redesign/list-clock.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"190\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mrgn-tp-lg\"><a class=\"btn btn-default btn-block\" href=\"/en/services/life-events/retirement/questionnaire.html\">Start the questionnaire</a></p>\n\t\t\t</section><section class=\"cards bg-retirement-hub-light flex-grow-1 mrgn-tp-lg\"><div class=\"media\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"media-body\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"mrgn-tp-md\">Estimate your retirement income</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"media\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"media-body\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mrgn-tp-md mrgn-bttm-0\">Use the following tools to find benefits and help plan your retirement income.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"media-right media-middle hidden-xs hidden-sm\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img class=\"mrgn-tp-md hidden-lg\" src=\"/content/dam/themes/retirement/images/redesign/calculator.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"60\"><img class=\"mrgn-tp-md hidden-md\" src=\"/content/dam/themes/retirement/images/redesign/calculator.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"70\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"media-right media-middle hidden-xs hidden-md hidden-lg\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img class=\"mrgn-tp-md\" src=\"/content/dam/themes/retirement/images/redesign/calculator.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<img class=\"center-block img-responsive mrgn-tp-lg hidden-sm hidden-md hidden-lg\" src=\"/content/dam/themes/retirement/images/redesign/calculator-sparkles.png\" alt=\"\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"list-unstyled\"><li class=\"mrgn-tp-lg\"><a class=\"btn btn-success btn-block\" href=\"/en/services/benefits/publicpensions/cpp/retirement-income-calculator.html\">Canada Retirement Income Calculator</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"mrgn-tp-md\"><a class=\"btn btn-success btn-block\" href=\"https://estimateursv-oasestimator.service.canada.ca/en\">Old Age Security Benefits Estimator</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"mrgn-tp-md\"><a class=\"btn btn-success btn-block\" href=\"/en/services/benefits/finder.html\">Benefits Finder</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t</ul></section></div>\n\t\t<nav class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-8 main-content small\"><h2 class=\"wb-inv\">Topics</h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"row wb-eqht-grd\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-xs-12\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mrgn-tp-lg hidden-md hidden-lg\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"position-relative\"><div class=\"cards light-hover hght-inhrt\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"media\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"media-body\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/en/services/life-events/retirement/prepare.html\" class=\"stretched-link\"><h3 class=\"h4 mrgn-tp-md\">Prepare for retirement</h3></a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Plan ahead and consider when to start your pensions, working while receiving public pensions, living with a limited income and options for living abroad.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</section></div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-6 mrgn-tp-lg\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"position-relative\"><div class=\"cards light-hover hght-inhrt\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"media\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"media-body\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/en/services/life-events/retirement/sources-income.html\" class=\"stretched-link\"><h3 class=\"h4 mrgn-tp-md\">Sources of income during retirement</h3></a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Learn about the different public pensions, employer pension plans, personal savings, and other financial support.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</section></div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-6 mrgn-tp-lg\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"position-relative\"><div class=\"cards light-hover hght-inhrt\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"media\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"media-body\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/en/services/life-events/retirement/apply-manage-your-pensions.html\" class=\"stretched-link\"><h3 class=\"h4 mrgn-tp-md\">Apply and manage your public pensions</h3></a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Apply for public pensions and benefits, manage your account, view pension details, and update your personal information.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</section></div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-6 mrgn-tp-lg\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"position-relative\"><div class=\"cards light-hover hght-inhrt\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"media\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"media-body\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/en/services/life-events/retirement/protect-yourself-scams-fraud.html\" class=\"stretched-link\"><h3 class=\"h4 mrgn-tp-md\">Protect yourself from scams and fraud</h3></a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Learn how to report a scam or fraud, how to spot them and keep your personal information safe.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</section></div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-6 mrgn-tp-lg\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"position-relative\"><div class=\"cards light-hover hght-inhrt\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"media\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"media-body\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/en/services/life-events/retirement/health-wellness.html\" class=\"stretched-link\"><h3 class=\"h4 mrgn-tp-md\">Health and wellness</h3></a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Find housing and home care resources for seniors and learn about CPP Disability and dental care benefits.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</section></div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-6 mrgn-tp-lg\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"position-relative\"><div class=\"cards light-hover hght-inhrt\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"media\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"media-body\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/en/services/life-events/retirement/stories.html\" class=\"stretched-link\"><h3 class=\"h4 mrgn-tp-md\">Retirement stories</h3></a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Learn about the different choices people make about when to take their public pensions.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</section></div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-6 mrgn-tp-lg\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"position-relative\"><div class=\"cards light-hover hght-inhrt\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"media\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"media-body\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/en/services/life-events/retirement/contact-us.html\" class=\"stretched-link\"><h3 class=\"h4 mrgn-tp-md\">Contact us</h3></a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>If you have questions or need help with your public pensions, contact us by phone, visit us in person, or submit a request form online.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</section></div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</nav></div>\n\t\n</div>\n\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"mwsmediaplayer section\">\n\n    <script>\n/*Inject custom CSS*/\nconst customCss = document.createElement(\"style\");\n\ncustomCss.innerHTML = `\n/*Set Thematic colours*/\nh1#wb-cont.retirement-hub {\n\tborder-bottom: 0.18em solid #0A747D;\n\tborder-image: linear-gradient(to right, #0A747D 71px, transparent 71px);\n\tborder-image-slice: 1;\n}\n\n.text-retirement-hub {\n\tcolor: #0A747D;\n}\n\n.bg-retirement-hub {\n\tbackground-color: #0A747D;\n\tcolor: #fff;\n}\n\n.bg-retirement-hub-light {\n\tbackground-color: #EEE;\n}\n\n.cards {\n\tpadding: 20px;\n\tbox-shadow: 0px 2px 3px 0px #cccccc;\n\tborder-radius: 10px;\n}\n\n.btn-retirement-hub.btn-primary, .retirement-hub .wb-steps.quiz .btn-primary {\n\tbackground-color: #0A747D;\n}\n\n.btn-retirement-hub.btn-primary:active, .btn-retirement-hub.btn-primary:focus, .btn-retirement-hub.btn-primary:hover, .retirement-hub .wb-steps.quiz .btn-primary:active, .retirement-hub .wb-steps.quiz .btn-primary:focus, .retirement-hub .wb-steps.quiz .btn-primary:hover {\n\tbackground-color: #EEE;\n\tcolor: #0A747D;\n}\n\n.btn-retirement-hub.btn-default, .retirement-hub .wb-steps.quiz .btn-default {\n\tbackground-color: #fff;\n\tborder-color: #0A747D;\n\tcolor: #0A747D;\n}\n\n.btn-retirement-hub.btn-default:active, .btn-retirement-hub.btn-default:focus, .btn-retirement-hub.btn-default:hover, .retirement-hub .wb-steps.quiz .btn-default:active, .retirement-hub .wb-steps.quiz .btn-default:focus, .retirement-hub .wb-steps.quiz .btn-default:hover {\n\tbackground-color: #EEE;\n\tborder-color: #0A747D;\n\tcolor: #0A747D;\n}\n\n.retirement-hub .cards.dark-hover:hover {\n\tbackground-color: #0A747D;\n\tcolor: white;\n}\n.retirement-hub .cards.dark-hover:hover a {\n\tbackground-color: #0A747D;\n\tcolor: white;\n}\n.retirement-hub .cards.light-hover:hover {\n\tbackground-color: #EEE;\n\tcolor: black;\n}\n.retirement-hub .cards.light-hover:hover a {\n\tcolor: black;\n}\n.retirement-hub .wb-steps.quiz progress {\n\t-webkit-appearance: none;\n\t-moz-appearance: none;\n\tappearance: none;\n\tborder: #0A747D solid 1px;\n\tbackground-color: #EEE;\n\tcolor: #EEE;\n}\n.retirement-hub .wb-steps.quiz progress::-webkit-progress-bar {\n\tbackground-color: #EEE;\n}\n.retirement-hub .wb-steps.quiz progress::-webkit-progress-value {\n\tbackground-color: #0A747D;\n}\n.retirement-hub .wb-steps.quiz progress::-moz-progress-bar {\n\t